note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note qg codegen port from CUDApp 22ebf8f.
note Input wire0..11 = full-width spec fields; wire15 = nonnull spec; wire16 = nonnull output.
note Query output meta32..43 and meta48; builder output uses standard IR records.
fn qo s edit ulong 2048 ok ulong dst ulong group ulong cols ulong guard ulong to void
plan = new ulong 64 0
v = native_qgorder plan group cols 1 guard
put s ok v
j = ulong 0
while lt j 64
put s add dst j get plan j
j = add j 1
end
end

